From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dpu: print the stored video vblank reference count

Both video IRQ tracepoints store refcnt correctly but print drm_id again
in its place. This made the Uke slave report 35 references despite not
owning a vblank IRQ. Print the actual stored field without changing IRQ
registration, reference accounting or event layout.

Signed-off-by: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_trace.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_trace.h
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_trace.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_trace.h
@@ -622,7 +622,7 @@
 	),
 	TP_printk("id=%u, intf_idx=%d refcnt=%d", __entry->drm_id,
 		  __entry->intf_idx,
-		  __entry->drm_id)
+		  __entry->refcnt)
 );
 
 TRACE_EVENT(dpu_enc_phys_vid_irq_disable,
@@ -641,7 +641,7 @@
 	),
 	TP_printk("id=%u, intf_idx=%d refcnt=%d", __entry->drm_id,
 		  __entry->intf_idx,
-		  __entry->drm_id)
+		  __entry->refcnt)
 );
 
 TRACE_EVENT(dpu_crtc_setup_mixer,
